# Local environment template

This repository's root JS comments document these names. Values stay out of git.

The `.env` currently in a working copy may use different key names — inspect with
`node scripts/inspect-repo.js` or MCP `get_env_key_names` (names only).

```
MONGODB_URI=
MONGODB_URI_PRODUCTION=
MONGODB_DB=
TELECRM_ENTERPRISE_ID=
TELECRM_API_TOKEN=
TELECRM_AUTOUPDATE_TOKEN=
TELECRM_SYNC_API2=
TELECRM_ASYNC_API2=
N8N_BASE_URL=
N8N_API_KEY=
PORT=3000
NEW_TELECRM_PUSH_SOURCE=false
```
